---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience — Luis Meyehen Paz"
  description="Cloud and data engineering, 2019 to today. Simple, honest, no fluff."
  session="journalctl"
  footPrompt="$ journalctl -u luis@cloud --no-pager ▮"
>
  <main class="screen sess-main">
    <div class="container screen-inner">
      <div class="screen-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">journalctl · experience</p>
        <h2>Seven years in data and cloud.</h2>
        <p>Cloud and data engineering, 2019 to today. What I did, in plain words.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="exp-list">
        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">10/2023 — now</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Interbank <span class="exp-role">· Platform Engineer · Peru (remote)</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ I help data science teams work faster.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">I build and maintain the data platform used by the Data Science team: automated pipelines, self-service tools, monitoring, and drift detection. I also automate repetitive data workflows with AI tools.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">08/2022 — 10/2023</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Prisma Medios de Pago <span class="exp-role">· AWS Data Platform Engineer</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ Made the data platform easier to maintain and ingestion more reliable.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">I worked almost leading the creation of data pipelines. I helped migrate the platform to infrastructure-as-code, built pipelines that bring data from internal and external sources into the company data lake, and added quality checks and monitoring.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="exp-row">
          <span class="meta">10/2021 — 08/2022</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Tiendanube <span class="exp-role">· Data Platform Engineer</span></h3>
            <p class="exp-impact">→ Helped build the company data platform so teams could query data directly.</p>
            <p class="exp-detail">Early stage of the data platform: I helped set it up from scratch so teams could query data with SQL instead of asking for exports.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <p class="meta" style="margin-top: 20px;">Earlier: Walmart (Oracle Cloud migration) · Tsoft · Monsun · Dthink — ETL, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, Power BI. Full log in <a class="project-link" href="/cv.pdf" download="LuisPaz-CV.pdf">LuisPaz-CV.pdf</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
